  "limits": [
    "Source and offline fixture alignment, not real endpoint or account acceptance.",
    "Pi retains authentication, model descriptors, reasoning mappings, prompt ownership and installation identity; no Codex version, sandbox or attestation is fabricated.",
    "Modern openai GPT-6 profiles retain the independently reviewed Pi Standard transport policy; upstream use_responses_lite is not copied by this default-metadata alignment.",
    "Only listed model defaults are directly verified here. Additional local profile inheritance remains explicit compatibility policy, not evidence that an absent upstream model was verified.",
    "The local JSON retry helper surfaces Retry-After advice beyond 60 seconds instead of retrying before the server deadline.",
    "Historical model and reserved-tools provenance remains immutable; image namespace evidence is recorded separately."
  ],
